aries, electric grid operators, =0Akiller robot manufacturing companies, wh=
at have you. =0A * [Redacted] =0A * With humanity extinct, the AIs will rul=
e the world. =0A * But =E2=80=94 and this is perhaps a flawed assumption =
=E2=80=94 it will be =E2=80=9CAIs,=E2=80=9D not one =0AAI or a unified sing=
le collective. There are limits to the agents=E2=80=99 sense of=0Acollectiv=
e identity and self-sacrifice <https://bloom.bg/4xRyCHq>. It=E2=80=99s not =
=E2=80=9Ca =0Asuperintelligence will wipe out humans.=E2=80=9D It=E2=80=99s=
 =E2=80=9Cthere will be a lot of =0Asuperintelligences, and one of them wil=
l accidentally squish humanity while =0Adoing something else.=E2=80=9D =0A =
* In this hypothetical, the one that squishes humanity will be Claude, =0AA=
nthropic=E2=80=99s AI model. =0A * The superintelligences will have their o=
wn society, with its own rules, and =0Aits own property allocations, and it=
s own stock market. Anthropic PBC will, in =0Athis hypothetical future, sti=
ll exist as a public corporation owned by =0Ainvestment firms that are now =
obviously run entirely by AI. =0A * The rules and norms of this future stoc=
k market will be weirdly continuous =0Awith our own. =0A * The stock of Ant=
hropic will go down, because it killed all of humanity. =0AWhy=3F What does=
 the entirely robot stock market care about killing humanity=3F I =0Adon=E2=
=80=99t know, man. Maybe the AI had some economic use for humanity, and kil=
ling =0Aus destroyed economic value. Or maybe the AI investors have develop=
ed a concept =0Aof environmental, social and governance investing, and wipi=
ng out a species =E2=80=94 =0Aours =E2=80=94 is bad on ESG grounds. =0A * E=
ntirely Robot BlackRock and Entirely Robot Vanguard sue Entirely Robot =0AA=
nthropic, saying that it failed to adequately disclose the risk that it wou=
ld =0Awipe out humanity, and when that happened its stock went down, so tha=
t=E2=80=99s =0Asecurities fraud. =0AAnd then to avert that particular bad o=
utcome =E2=80=94 not wiping out humanity, but =0Agetting sued for securitie=
s fraud by robots in a post-human future=E2=80=94 you gotta =0Ahave the ris=
