1]</span> </a></p> <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;">To get the right level of i=
nterest-rate risk, the asset manager might then buy some Treasury futures c=
ontracts, derivatives contracts tied to the prices of Treasury bonds. The f=
utures contracts allow the asset manager to effectively own long-term Treas=
uries, without paying for them yet.&nbsp;And then the basis trade is that h=
edge funds will buy the underlying Treasury bonds, sell the Treasury future=
s to asset managers, and collect a spread for their trouble.</p> <p style=
=3D"margin: 16px 0;">Let=E2=80=99s say that the asset manager buys the corp=
orate bonds she wants, and then solves for how much Treasury futures she ne=
eds to get the duration she wants. She might do the math and decide she wan=
ts to own, say, $100 million of 20-year Treasury futures. Or maybe she want=
s a bit less duration, so she buys 15-year Treasury futures. Or a bit more,=
 so she buys 25-year Treasury futures. Fine, yes, good.</p> <p style=3D"mar=
gin: 16px 0;">The problem is that =E2=80=9C20-year Treasury futures,=E2=80=
=9D or =E2=80=9C15-year Treasury futures=E2=80=9D or =E2=80=9C25-year Treas=
ury futures,=E2=80=9D are not quite things. Instead there is a thing called=
 the =E2=80=9CTreasury bond futures contract,=E2=80=9D which has the follow=
ing odd property:</p> <ol style=3D"list-style-type: decimal; padding-left: =
40px; margin: 16px 0;"> <li style=3D"margin-bottom: 5px;">When long-term Tr=
easury interest rates are lower than 6%, it is a 15-year Treasury futures c=
ontract.</li> <li style=3D"margin-bottom: 5px;">When long-term Treasury int=
erest rates are higher than 6%, it is a 25-year Treasury futures contract.<=
/li> </ol> <p style=3D"margin: 16px 0;">This&nbsp;makes sense in its contex=
t. The context is that the Treasury bond future is, approximately, a future=
s contract on an imaginary&nbsp;object that is a&nbsp;20-year Treasury bond=
 with a 6% yield. From Frank Fabozzi=E2=80=99s<em>&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://=
links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/BR_LawBVWoYXTmVvoidcrIe6Z_fCgr4xaIBJC5jH-Qp=
LBJweC3-mLkq8O54rntkw8UHlgDBP7Gn9Uo0kRwpdx5k351QQykHfNczyruxMkxuF4fVtWcwxNp=
